  page.innerHTML = "\n<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<!-- SCHEDULER: All data-booking links use the company Microsoft Bookings URL. See documentation/microsoft-bookings.md. -->\n<header class=\"header\"><div class=\"container nav\"><a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"MeNow home\"><img class=\"logo\" src=\"assets/menow-white.svg\" width=\"590\" height=\"122\" alt=\"MeNow\"></a><nav id=\"main-navigation\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"#market\">Market</a><a href=\"#applications\">Applications</a><a href=\"#advantage\">Why MeNow</a><a href=\"#science\">Science</a><a href=\"#partnership\">Licensing</a><a href=\"#about\">About</a><a href=\"#ip-factory\">IP Factory</a><a href=\"#faq\">FAQ</a></nav><button class=\"menu-toggle\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-controls=\"main-navigation\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n\n<a class=\"button button-secondary\" data-booking href=\"https://bookings.cloud.microsoft/book/MeNowintroductionmeeting@menow.ai/s/P_V2sdc3F0GJzpgIi8b1aA2?ismsaljsauthenabled\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <span class=\"primary-label\">Let\u2019s&nbsp;talk</span>\n  <svg class=\"cta-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <path d=\"M6 18L18 6M6 6h12v12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n  </svg>\n</a>\n</div></header>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero hero-editorial\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\">\n  <div class=\"hero-stage\">\n    <div class=\"hero-scenes\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><video class=\"hero-film\" muted loop playsinline preload=\"metadata\" poster=\"assets/muscle-health-poster.jpg?v=3\" tabindex=\"-1\"><source src=\"assets/muscle-health-hero.mp4?v=4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\n    <div class=\"container hero-content\">\n      <div class=\"hero-copy\">\n        <div class=\"hero-text-panel\">\n          <p class=\"context-label\">Muscle preservation / Technology licensing</p>\n          <h1 id=\"hero-title\">Strength. Mobility.<br><span>Quality of life.</span></h1>\n          <p class=\"hero-description\">License a new direction in muscle health. MeNow\u2019s patent-pending portfolio of bioactive compounds offers opportunities to develop nutrition products focused on muscle preservation across healthy aging, weight management and active lifestyles.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"button button-gold\" data-booking href=\"https://bookings.cloud.microsoft/book/MeNowintroductionmeeting@menow.ai/s/P_V2sdc3F0GJzpgIi8b1aA2?ismsaljsauthenabled\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"primary-label\">Explore licensing opportunities</span><svg class=\"cta-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18L18 6M6 6h12v12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"container scene-footer\"><div class=\"hero-facts\"><ul class=\"fact-tags unified-facts\"><li class=\"mobile-hidden-fact\">Muscle-preservation portfolio</li><li>Patent-pending innovation</li><li>Available for licensing</li></ul></div><button class=\"video-control hero-film-control\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Play background video\" title=\"Play background video\"><svg class=\"play-icon\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg><svg class=\"pause-icon\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 5h3v14H7zM14 5h3v14h-3z\"/></svg></button></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section section-light business\" id=\"market\" aria-labelledby=\"market-title\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <p class=\"context-label section-annotation\">Market opportunity</p>\n    <h2 id=\"market-title\">Muscle health.<br>A growing priority across life stages.</h2>\n    <div class=\"market-introduction body-copy\">\n      <p>Healthy aging, the rise of GLP-1-led weight management and active lifestyles are bringing muscle preservation into focus. For nutrition brands, this creates an opportunity to address muscle health across more stages of life.</p>\n      <p>MeNow\u2019s compound portfolio offers a foundation for exploring new muscle-support applications, from dedicated healthy-aging products to additions to existing weight-management and sports-nutrition lines.</p>\n    </div>\n    \n  </div>\n</section><section class=\"section section-light application-story aging-story\" id=\"applications\" aria-labelledby=\"applications-title\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <p class=\"context-label section-annotation\">Application opportunities</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"container application-story-grid\">\n <div class=\"application-story-visual\"><img src=\"assets/application-aging-coral.png\" alt=\"Older woman in a coral top practicing meditation outdoors.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n <div class=\"application-story-copy\"><p class=\"context-label\">Healthy aging</p><h2 id=\"applications-title\">Support an active,<br>independent future.</h2><p>Strength and mobility shape everyday life. For brands serving an aging audience, muscle preservation offers a focused direction for nutrition products built around staying active and independent.</p><div class=\"application-opportunity\"><h3>Develop a healthy-aging concept</h3><p>Explore MeNow\u2019s bioactive portfolio as a starting point for a dedicated muscle-health product or a new application within an existing healthy-aging range.</p></div></div>\n </div></section><section class=\"section section-light application-story \" id=\"weight-management\" aria-labelledby=\"weight-management-title\"><div class=\"container application-story-grid\">\n <div class=\"application-story-visual\"><img src=\"assets/application-weight-coral.png\" alt=\"Woman in a coral top and white overshirt preparing a green smoothie.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n <div class=\"application-story-copy\"><p class=\"context-label\">Weight management</p><h2 id=\"weight-management-title\">Make muscle preservation<br>part of the story.</h2><p>Weight-management products can address more than the number on the scale. Muscle support offers a complementary focus for brands developing nutrition around weight loss, including GLP-1-led programs.</p><div class=\"application-opportunity\"><h3>Extend your weight-management range</h3><p>Explore a muscle-preservation application alongside your existing nutrition offering, with candidate selection and evaluation shaped by your intended audience and product format.</p></div></div>\n </div></section><section class=\"section section-light application-story \" id=\"sports-recovery\" aria-labelledby=\"sports-recovery-title\"><div class=\"container application-story-grid\">\n <div class=\"application-story-visual\"><img src=\"assets/application-sports-coral.png\" alt=\"Man lifting a dumbbell in a gym, wearing a coral athletic top.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n <div class=\"application-story-copy\"><p class=\"context-label\">Sports nutrition &amp; recovery</p><h2 id=\"sports-recovery-title\">Expand the opportunity<br>beyond performance.</h2><p>Active consumers bring muscle health and recovery into the same conversation. This creates room for nutrition concepts that connect training goals with a longer-term focus on strength and mobility.</p><div class=\"application-opportunity\"><h3>Build a recovery-focused concept</h3><p>Explore bioactive applications for sports nutrition and recovery. Rehabilitation is a related development direction to assess with relevant clinical and research partners.</p></div></div>\n </div></section>\n<section class=\"section section-dark menow-advantage\" id=\"advantage\" aria-labelledby=\"advantage-title\"><div class=\"container\"><p class=\"context-label section-annotation\">MeNow&nbsp;advantage</p><div class=\"advantage-intro\"><h2 id=\"advantage-title\">Practical path to&nbsp;market.<br><span class=\"advantage-heading-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2192</span> Strong start for commercial development.</h2></div><div class=\"advantage-grid\"><article><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 4 6v6c0 5 8 9 8 9s8-4 8-9V6l-8-3Z\"/><path d=\"m8 12 3 3 5-6\"/></svg><h3>Food-approved</h3><p>Explore new applications for food-approved ingredients. Build on established food uses as you assess the requirements of your product and target&nbsp;market.</p></article><article><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5 9-5ZM3 8v9l9 5 9-5V8M12 13v9M7.5 5.5l9 5\"/></svg><h3>Use existing supply&nbsp;chains</h3><p>Build on commercially available ingredients and established suppliers, creating a practical starting point for sourcing and production&nbsp;planning.</p></article><article><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 21V11h5v10M10 21V7h5v14M16 21V3h5v18M2 21h21\"/></svg><h3>Keep scale-up costs in&nbsp;view</h3><p>Existing ingredient production can reduce the need to develop dedicated manufacturing from scratch, helping you assess commercial feasibility&nbsp;earlier.</p></article><article><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"8\"/><path d=\"M9 2h6M12 5V2M12 9v4l3 2M19 6l2-2\"/></svg><h3>Move development forward&nbsp;faster</h3><p>Start with an existing ingredient and focus development on its new application, from formulation and performance evaluation to commercial&nbsp;integration.</p></article></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"section science\" id=\"science\" aria-labelledby=\"science-title\"><div class=\"container\"><p class=\"context-label section-annotation\">Scientific approach</p><h2 id=\"science-title\">A targeted bioactive portfolio<br>for muscle health.</h2><div class=\"science-portfolio body-copy\"><p>MeNow\u2019s computational biology platform identified a portfolio of bioactive candidates for their potential relevance to muscle preservation. The portfolio brings a targeted discovery approach to opportunities across aging, weight management and recovery.</p><p>Partners can explore the scientific rationale and available candidate-specific information with MeNow, then define the evaluation needed for their intended application.</p></div><div class=\"section-action\"><a class=\"button button-gold\" data-booking href=\"https://bookings.cloud.microsoft/book/MeNowintroductionmeeting@menow.ai/s/P_V2sdc3F0GJzpgIi8b1aA2?ismsaljsauthenabled\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"primary-label\">Explore the science</span><svg class=\"cta-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18L18 6M6 6h12v12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a></div></div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section section-dark partnership\" id=\"partnership\" aria-labelledby=\"partnership-title\"><div class=\"container\">\n<p class=\"context-label section-annotation\">Partner with&nbsp;MeNow</p><div class=\"heading-grid\"><div class=\"annotated-heading\"><h2 id=\"partnership-title\">Your next muscle-health product.<br><span class=\"accent-text\">Built on MeNow\u2019s discoveries.</span></h2></div>\n<div class=\"body-copy\"><p>MeNow offers licensing opportunities for its patent-pending muscle-preservation compound applications and associated intellectual property. Partners can explore the portfolio in relation to a specific product, audience and market.</p>\n<p>We welcome nutrition and nutraceutical brands, ingredient companies and formulation teams. An introductory meeting can identify relevant candidates, review the available technical information and define evaluation priorities and potential licensing scope.</p>\n<p>MeNow\u2019s commercial offer is intellectual-property licensing. Ingredient sourcing and supply are handled separately.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"partner-topics\" aria-label=\"Meeting topics\"><span>Candidate and application fit</span><span>Technical information and evaluation</span><span>Licensing scope and next steps</span></div><div class=\"section-action\"><a class=\"button button-gold\" data-booking href=\"https://bookings.cloud.microsoft/book/MeNowintroductionmeeting@menow.ai/s/P_V2sdc3F0GJzpgIi8b1aA2?ismsaljsauthenabled\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"primary-label\">Explore licensing opportunities</span><svg class=\"cta-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18L18 6M6 6h12v12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"section section-light about\" id=\"about\" aria-labelledby=\"about-title\"><div class=\"container\"><p class=\"context-label section-annotation\">About&nbsp;MeNow</p><h2 id=\"about-title\">Computational biology.<br>Commercial applications in&nbsp;mind.</h2><div class=\"about-columns\"><div class=\"about-company body-copy\"><p>MeNow is a EU-funded deep-tech company founded by two PhD scientists, with an 18-person R&amp;D team across AI, cheminformatics, physics and molecular&nbsp;biology.</p></div><div class=\"body-copy\"><p>Our platform combines proprietary molecular data with predictive AI to discover new functions and commercial applications for existing&nbsp;ingredients.</p><p>Our commercial offering is licensing of ingredient applications and custom discovery. Partners can explore new functionality for existing ingredients through MeNow\u2019s intellectual&nbsp;property.</p></div></div><dl class=\"about-stats\" aria-label=\"MeNow in numbers\"><div><dt>Years of discovery</dt><dd>5+</dd></div><div><dt>Patents pending</dt><dd>12</dd></div><div><dt>PhDs on the team</dt><dd>50%</dd></div></dl></div></section>\n<section class=\"section section-light ip-factory\" id=\"ip-factory\" aria-labelledby=\"ip-factory-title\"><div class=\"container\"><p class=\"context-label section-annotation\">IP Factory</p><h2 id=\"ip-factory-title\">From application ideas<br>to licensing opportunities.</h2><div class=\"ip-visual-layout\"><figure class=\"ip-level-visual\"><img src=\"assets/ip-factory-levels-v2.png?v=themed-1\" width=\"1122\" height=\"1402\" alt=\"Three connected scientific layers: data and AI at the base, molecular discovery in the middle, and a coral patent document and seal representing intellectual property opportunities at the top.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"ip-level-copy\"><article><span class=\"ip-direction-label\">Outcome</span><h3>Patent &amp; licensing opportunities</h3><p>Develop new ingredient applications into intellectual property and opportunities for partners to&nbsp;license.</p></article><article><span class=\"ip-direction-label\">Engine</span><h3>Molecular discovery</h3><p>Identify promising molecules, predict their properties, and prioritize candidates for experimental&nbsp;evaluation.</p></article><article><span class=\"ip-direction-label\">Foundation</span><h3>Exclusive data + proprietary AI</h3><p>Predictive models analyze <strong>60K+ organisms</strong> and <strong>2M+ natural molecules</strong> to uncover new functions in food-approved&nbsp;ingredients.</p></article></div></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"section section-light faq\" id=\"faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\"><div class=\"container\"><p class=\"context-label section-annotation\">Frequently asked questions</p><h2 id=\"faq-title\">A closer look.</h2><div class=\"faq-list portfolio-faq\"><details><summary>What is MeNow offering?<span class=\"faq-toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>A patent-pending portfolio of bioactive compound applications with potential relevance to muscle preservation, available for licensing and application-specific development.</p></details><details><summary>Does MeNow supply the compounds?<span class=\"faq-toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>MeNow licenses intellectual property and ingredient applications rather than selling ingredients. A technical meeting can clarify sourcing considerations for the candidates relevant to your project.</p></details><details><summary>Which products could this portfolio support?<span class=\"faq-toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Potential areas include healthy-aging nutrition, weight management, sports nutrition and recovery-focused products. Candidate selection and formulation depend on the intended audience, format and market.</p></details><details><summary>How does this relate to GLP-1 weight management?<span class=\"faq-toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Muscle preservation is a potential product-development focus alongside GLP-1-led weight management. This portfolio concerns muscle-health applications; it is separate from MeNow\u2019s FitMeNow\u2122 satiety opportunity.</p></details><details><summary>What evidence is available for the compounds?<span class=\"faq-toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>MeNow can review the scientific rationale and available candidate-specific information with prospective partners, then identify the evaluation needed for the intended application.</p></details><details><summary>What does the food-use foundation mean for formulation?<span class=\"faq-toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Existing food uses and sourcing can provide a practical starting point. The selected compound, formulation, use level and target market determine the requirements for a new application.</p></details><details><summary>What can be included in a license?<span class=\"faq-toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>The relevant compound applications and associated intellectual property are discussed with each partner. Application scope, territory, rights and commercial terms are defined in the licensing agreement.</p></details><details><summary>How can we get started?<span class=\"faq-toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Bring your target audience, product format and market to an introductory meeting. Together we can explore candidate fit, technical information and next steps for evaluation and licensing.</p></details></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"closing muscle-closing\"><div class=\"container closing-inner\"><div class=\"muscle-closing-copy\"><p class=\"context-label\">Let\u2019s explore the fit</p><h2>Bring muscle preservation<br> into your next product.</h2><p class=\"closing-description\">Tell us who you\u2019re developing for. Let\u2019s explore how MeNow\u2019s portfolio could fit your product goals.</p><a class=\"button button-gold\" data-booking href=\"https://bookings.cloud.microsoft/book/MeNowintroductionmeeting@menow.ai/s/P_V2sdc3F0GJzpgIi8b1aA2?ismsaljsauthenabled\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"primary-label\">Talk with our team</span><svg class=\"cta-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18L18 6M6 6h12v12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a></div></div></section>\n</main><footer><div class=\"container footer-inner\"><a class=\"footer-brand\" href=\"https://www.menow.ai/\" aria-label=\"MeNow home\"><img class=\"logo\" src=\"assets/menow-white.svg\" width=\"590\" height=\"122\" alt=\"MeNow\"></a><div class=\"footer-contact\"><a href=\"mailto:support@menow.ai\">support@menow.ai</a><p>\u00a9 2026 MeNow, Ltd. All rights reserved.</p></div></div></footer>\n\n\n\n";
